<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#c13617;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70;">    -</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> PR 생성 시 본문에 </span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">\`Resolves #&lt;이슈-번호&gt;\`</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> 또는 </span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">\`Closes #&lt;이슈-번호&gt;\`</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">를 포함하여 이슈를 자동으로 연결하고 닫히도록 합니다.</span></span>
